      "homePageType": "html",
      "homePageValue": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Smart Health Operations - Clinical Analytics</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n            background-color: #f0fdfa;\n            color: #1f2937;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        .header {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #134e4a 0%, #0f766e 50%, #14b8a6 100%);\n            color: white;\n            padding: 2rem 1rem;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .header-content {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .logo {\n            font-size: 2rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n        }\n\n        .tagline {\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            opacity: 0.95;\n            font-weight: 300;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 2rem 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .welcome-section {\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 2.5rem;\n            margin-bottom: 2rem;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.08);\n            border-left: 4px solid #14b8a6;\n        }\n\n        .welcome-section h1 {\n            color: #1f2937;\n            font-size: 2rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        .welcome-section p {\n            color: #4b5563;\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .section-title {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            color: #1f2937;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .section-title::before {\n            content: '';\n            width: 4px;\n            height: 24px;\n            background: #14b8a6;\n            margin-right: 12px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n            gap: 1.5rem;\n            margin-bottom: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-card {\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 1.75rem;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.08);\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n            border-top: 3px solid #0f766e;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-4px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.15);\n        }\n\n        .kpi-card.accent-1 {\n            border-top-color: #0f766e;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-card.accent-2 {\n            border-top-color: #134e4a;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-card.accent-3 {\n            border-top-color: #14b8a6;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-header {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-title {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: #6b7280;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n            font-weight: 500;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-icon {\n            width: 40px;\n            height: 40px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f766e 0%, #14b8a6 100%);\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            color: white;\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-value {\n            font-size: 2.5rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #1f2937;\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-change {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-change.positive {\n            color: #10b981;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-change.negative {\n            color: #ef4444;\n        }\n\n        .kpi-change.neutral {\n            color: #0f766e;\n        }\n\n        .quick-stats {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));\n            gap: 1rem;\n            margin-top: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .stat-item {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0fdfa 0%, #f5f5f5 100%);\n            padding: 1.25rem;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n        }\n\n        .stat-label {\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            color: #6b7280;\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n        }\n\n        .stat-value {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #0f766e;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .header { padding: 1.5rem 1rem; }\n            .logo { font-size: 1.5rem; }\n            .welcome-section { padding: 1.5rem; }\n            .welcome-section h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }\n            .welcome-section p { font-size: 1rem; }\n            .kpi-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n            .kpi-value { font-size: 2rem; }\n            .quick-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n        }\n\n        .footer {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 2rem 1rem;\n            color: #6b7280;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header class=\"header\">\n        <div class=\"header-content\">\n            <div class=\"logo\">Smart Health Operations</div>\n            <div class=\"tagline\">Hospital Clinical Operations Analytics Platform</div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main class=\"container\">\n        <section class=\"welcome-section\">\n            <h1>Welcome to Smart Health Operations</h1>\n            <p>\n                Your unified clinical operations command center. Monitor patient flow, bed capacity,\n                surgical scheduling, and workforce coverage — all from a single platform powered by\n                real-time data across your EMR, operations, and workforce systems.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n                Clinical ops teams today struggle with disconnected data that makes it impossible to\n                answer critical daily questions: how many encounters by service line, what is current\n                bed occupancy, are surgeries on schedule, and do you have enough nurses on the floor.\n                Smart Health Operations brings it all together for better care and better outcomes.\n            </p>\n        </section>\n\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Key Performance Indicators</h2>\n\n        <div class=\"kpi-grid\">\n            <div class=\"kpi-card accent-1\">\n                <div class=\"kpi-header\">\n                    <div class=\"kpi-title\">Daily Patient Encounters</div>\n                    <div class=\"kpi-icon\">🏥</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-value\">1,284</div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-change positive\">\n                    <span>▲</span>\n                    <span>6.2% vs last week</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"kpi-card accent-2\">\n                <div class=\"kpi-header\">\n                    <div class=\"kpi-title\">Bed Occupancy Rate</div>\n                    <div class=\"kpi-icon\">🛏</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-value\">87.3%</div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-change neutral\">\n                    <span>⬤</span>\n                    <span>High — monitor capacity</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"kpi-card accent-3\">\n                <div class=\"kpi-header\">\n                    <div class=\"kpi-title\">Surgical Cases Today</div>\n                    <div class=\"kpi-icon\">🔬</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-value\">42</div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-change positive\">\n                    <span>▲</span>\n                    <span>On schedule</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"kpi-card accent-1\">\n                <div class=\"kpi-header\">\n                    <div class=\"kpi-title\">Nurse-to-Patient Ratio</div>\n                    <div class=\"kpi-icon\">👩‍⚕️</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-value\">1 : 4.2</div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-change positive\">\n                    <span>✓</span>\n                    <span>Within target</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"kpi-card accent-2\">\n                <div class=\"kpi-header\">\n                    <div class=\"kpi-title\">Avg ED Wait Time</div>\n                    <div class=\"kpi-icon\">⏱</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-value\">38 min</div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-change positive\">\n                    <span>▼</span>\n                    <span>12% faster than target</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"kpi-card accent-3\">\n                <div class=\"kpi-header\">\n                    <div class=\"kpi-title\">Staff Coverage</div>\n                    <div class=\"kpi-icon\">📋</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-value\">94.7%</div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-change positive\">\n                    <span>▲</span>\n                    <span>Shifts fully covered</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Quick Statistics</h2>\n\n        <div class=\"quick-stats\">\n            <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                <div class=\"stat-label\">ICU Beds Available</div>\n                <div class=\"stat-value\">8</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                <div class=\"stat-label\">Surgeries Pending</div>\n                <div class=\"stat-value\">17</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                <div class=\"stat-label\">Patients Discharged Today</div>\n                <div class=\"stat-value\">156</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                <div class=\"stat-label\">Open Nursing Shifts</div>\n                <div class=\"stat-value\">12</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <p>&copy; 2024 Smart Health Operations. All rights reserved. | Hospital Clinical Operations Analytics</p>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>",
